=== gnovm_run in plan mode ===
plan mode is on, and gnovm_run does not run in it: nothing in a Gno machine or in mem changes while you plan. gnovm_list still lists the machines. Once the user approves the plan, put it on mem first, as a todo with its steps, and then work it

=== gnovm_drop in plan mode ===
plan mode is on, and gnovm_drop does not run in it: nothing in a Gno machine or in mem changes while you plan. gnovm_list still lists the machines. Once the user approves the plan, put it on mem first, as a todo with its steps, and then work it

